<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Travelers/Aetna raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Travelers/Aetna raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded Travelers/Aetna Property Casualty Corp to buy from outperform and added the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- said the stock price has dropped 13 percent from a high set two weeks ago. Said this represents a strong buying opportunity.</p>
<p>-- said the shares appeared undervalued.</p>
<p>-- said a &quot;modest sized acquisition&quot; over the next 15 months would be accretive to 1998 earnings per share by $0.25 or more.</p>
<p>-- said company is one of the few insurance industry firms that is growing earnings rapidly and generating excess capital.</p>
<p>-- set a year-end price target of $44 a share.</p>
<p>-- Travelers/Aetna gained 1-3/4 to 35-5/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
